明日買うぞ。\n何チョコ作ろうかなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかゆるんでるなあ\n気を引き締めろ！自分！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまとまってない\n短文更新でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-47614":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF826N72ATP947P1W9G5VKA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> Happy Halloween て言おうと思ったら終わってたけどいっぱいハロウィン写真あるから11月だけど載せるね これは、プロップ遠藤歩さんカメラ藤城貴則さんチームマーキー！久しぶりに遠藤さんに会えた..会うといつもハッピーな気持ちになれる。大好きです..来年はもっと気合い入れていどもう..素敵な写真ができて嬉しいな～ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF827QGT1227VKFX1JK71TV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> アンダー曲MV公開されましたね～！寝顔とかサングラスとかね～ダンス好きなので注目！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF828SA543JZN4WY7Y7KMSK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> 猫舌SR見てくださった方ありがとうMCやらせていただきました～ハロウィンパーティーができて楽しかったですー(o^^o)ひたすらモグモグタイム...美味しい日々仲良くなってく気がする3期！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF829SHSNRM2QSPVZBKXM4B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> 11月も楽しみましょう...！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF82AVR70J6BPX3V5C94793","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> ばいぴち   "}],"source":"archive"}}